{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0343_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0343_1000_p", "source_sha256": "3cf1cb984d32a9ef6434f68ceb4df4a6a1b8b927c4af1f93264adef336c48ed7", "ja": "（今日はグラビア雑誌『アイグラ！！』のロケだ。\nスパイに扮した美希を撮影する予定だ……）", "zh": "（今天是写真杂志《偶像写真！！》的外景拍摄。接下来要拍摄化身间谍的美希……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0343_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0343_1001_003mik", "source_sha256": "2e20582da0a8cec2675aafd9c8c69f8a80b75d2c70a246051efcd06ce653c47d", "ja": "ねぇねぇ、{$P$}。\nミキのスパイ姿、どう？　セクシーでしょ？", "zh": "喂喂，{$P$}。美希这身间谍装怎么样？很性感吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0343_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0343_1002_p", "source_sha256": "0fe9a3d0a9b1bcb381509f0b71a7afc20b84d2d8b84e06c649a1e86ffaf61866", "ja": "ああ。\n思ってた以上にセクシーでよく似合ってるよ。", "zh": "是啊。\n比我想象中还要性感，很适合你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0343_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0343_1003_003mik", "source_sha256": "95a6e775e1d7f84b3e85021b9bf122febfb2548b85465abf5326c0c7b875f1bb", "ja": "よかった☆　今日は『スパイ』ってテーマだから\nミキ、ちょっとだけ頑張るの。", "zh": "太好了☆今天的主题是“间谍”，所以美希要稍微努力一下。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0343_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0343_1004_003mik", "source_sha256": "849ceacf5b77ffc3890b86bfcc9c5a8ba87c44967df99f4bab360cd0b4318976", "ja": "それでね、どんなポーズにしようか悩んでるの。だから\n{$P$}がドキドキするポーズ教えて？", "zh": "所以呢，我正在烦恼该摆什么姿势。能告诉我一个让{$P$}心跳加速的姿势吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0343_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0343_1005_p", "source_sha256": "0903cf15f2516e50b48ced12fec515cd57110df7dada09f3abbbf8ecb7159b31", "ja": "俺がドキドキする前提なのか……。まあ、いいや。\n提案だけど、クールなポーズにしてみるのはどうだ？", "zh": "前提是我会心动吗……算了。要不试试摆个帅气的姿势？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0343_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0343_1006_003mik", "source_sha256": "d00be6a802c82ecc41d35b14b7d947b8597525ee03e0b1cd8c8c63e394cdde26", "ja": "クールなポーズか……。{$P$}は、\nセクシーなミキ、見たくないの？", "zh": "酷帅的姿势吗……。{$P$}不想看看性感的美希吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0343_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0343_1007_p", "source_sha256": "e0ad84c907d40e4f2610127485010b96a2118fb9a5cbd360beb77a7c84ea52df", "ja": "見たくないわけ……じゃなくて！　美希はなんでも\n出来るから、優秀なスパイが似合うと思ったんだ。", "zh": "不是不想看……不是那个意思！美希什么都能做，\n我觉得她更适合扮演出色的间谍。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0343_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0343_1008_003mik", "source_sha256": "1ee0d7e83775f639b0cce090502402d5d6ccdc0043514679fb9cc7f8c2e8b16f", "ja": "ふーん……。それじゃ、{$P$}が\nイメージするクールなポーズって、どんな感じ？", "zh": "嗯……那么，{$P$}想象中的帅气姿势，是什么样的？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0343_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0343_1009_p", "source_sha256": "0ba317f91a61ed2bbeb156a5c36978311fae0c30e1a12a2081521d6d2b5d48a5", "ja": "そうだな……。武器を構えたり、\n周りを警戒しながら潜入する姿とか、かな？", "zh": "这个嘛……比如摆出举起武器的姿势，或者一边警戒四周一边潜入之类的？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0343_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0343_1010_003mik", "source_sha256": "3216927455c55161760a85840ab041f9638118f53094f7ae0f41fae3bd846eaa", "ja": "そっか。スパイって、こっそり秘密を探ったり、\n罠をみつけたりするお仕事だもんね。", "zh": "这样啊。间谍就是偷偷探查秘密、寻找陷阱的工作嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0343_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0343_1011_003mik", "source_sha256": "5c0517352412136b0ad6a20e0b68f9f7ffe21b730984ca1564b8daf5f86ab93d", "ja": "キリッてしたり、ビシッてすればいいんでしょ？\nそれなら簡単なの。", "zh": "摆出严肃的表情，再做得干脆利落一点就行了吧？那很简单的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0343_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0343_1012_p", "source_sha256": "5dd937241035d1d1e43cccc8647d399267caecd7d7ff64347be4fef2fb5ae1f5", "ja": "ああ、そうだな……。って、こんなことを聞くのは\nなんだけど、本当にそれでいいのか？", "zh": "啊，对啊……不过，虽然这么问有点那个，真的这样就行吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0343_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0343_1013_003mik", "source_sha256": "c79a3b6ed3da2478e4c5ba2cf35e7a59e13016ca2c9c7f674e662765442167e2", "ja": "うん、いいよ。だって、{$P$}は、\nセクシーでクールなミキが好きなんでしょ？", "zh": "嗯，没问题呀。因为，{$P$}\n最喜欢既性感又帅气的美希了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0343_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0343_1014_003mik", "source_sha256": "d3aaae9ff83327f31b241b65c0acc3f77e9c63da82964187175607700b852a95", "ja": "頭の中で、クールなミキのことを考えてたから、\nすぐに提案してくれたんだよね？", "zh": "因为你一直在脑海里想着帅气的美希，所以马上就提出来了，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0343_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0343_1015_p", "source_sha256": "20390a922c10557f3981586825ce70740d77353beb627c82a767206ee90288a8", "ja": "えっ！？　いや、それは……。", "zh": "咦！？不，那个……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0343_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0343_1016_003mik", "source_sha256": "fd36e76bfb06fc1ea8d90d03c89dbae3f571b43f0c6262578f8de010b528038f", "ja": "任せてなの！　{$P$}好みのスパイに\nなるから、ミキのこともっともっと考えてね☆", "zh": "包在我身上！我会成为符合{$P$}喜好的间谍，所以要更多更多地想着美希哦☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
